<title>MOROCCO: Arafat says next move up to Israelis.</title>
<headline>Arafat says next move up to Israelis.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat, breaking his silence on the U.S. summit with Israeli, Jordanian and American leaders, said on Thursday the future of the Middle East peace process depended on Israeli moves.</p>
<p>&quot;It depends how the Israelis will deal. Especially we are insisting they implement accurately and honestly what has been agreed upon and what was signed,&quot; he said before leaving for Tunis after talks with Moroccan King Hassan.</p>
</text>
